{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/30291-memories-while-in-arcadia","id":30291,"title":"Memories while in Arcadia","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-14T22:58:01-08:00","id":30291,"title":"Memories while in Arcadia","content":"I can't find anything in the book regarding if a changelings memories of his human past while he is in Arcadia are fragmented just as his memories of Arcadia are when he is back in the real world. Perhaps I just suck at reading. Can anybody shed light on this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1679-maximilian-thermidor","name":"Maximilian Thermidor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1679_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-15T03:44:18-08:00","id":30362,"title":"","content":"From what I understand, it depends. You can have Ogres remembering their human lives the whole time and waiting for the perfect occasion to run away, and Beasts who escape their Keeper only because they had a sudden spark of lucidity where they briefly recalled they used to have a name or a child, both in the same game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-16T23:28:15-08:00","id":31501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChairKicker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/30291-memories-while-in-arcadia?p=30362#post30362\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I understand, it depends. You can have Ogres remembering their human lives the whole time and waiting for the perfect occasion to run away, and Beasts who escape their Keeper only because they had a sudden spark of lucidity where they briefly recalled they used to have a name or a child, both in the same game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for the response.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1679-maximilian-thermidor","name":"Maximilian Thermidor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1679_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T00:35:11-08:00","id":31527,"title":"","content":"As I understand it Elemental's and Wizened tend to remember the most. Elemental's lose their human body to an element or elements but they usually retain their previous awarenesses. The process of becoming a wizened fills the changeling with rage and anger but it doesn't automatically wipe the slate clean.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1477-randompaul","name":"Randompaul","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T07:23:07-08:00","id":31645,"title":"","content":"Seems like it's as much or as little as the story requires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}